silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_01_olog_as_typed_english_sections_02_four_artifacts_of_olog_concrete_anchor_4_InstanceTables#mittensrowindomesticcattable silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensRowInDomesticCatTable is the instance-table set: rows witnessing each box; Mittens is one row of DomesticCatBox. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'InstanceTables', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
